---
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import portrait from '../assets/photos/abtin-portrait.jpg';
import { awards } from '../data/metrics';
---
<Base
  title="About | Abtin Aryanpour"
  description="Abtin Aryanpour, first-year Computer Engineering at Waterloo, on the Waterloo Aerial Robotics Group's autonomy team. Looking for a co-op, May to August 2027."
  current="about"
>
  <article class="about wrap grid">
    <div class="side">
      <Picture pictureAttributes={{ class: 'about-photo' }} src={portrait} alt="Abtin at a formal event in a suit and bow tie, pointing at the camera" widths={[400, 640, 900]} sizes="(max-width: 759px) 70vw, 34vw" formats={['avif', 'webp']} loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
    </div>

    <div class="main">
      <h1 class="display">About</h1>
      <p class="lead">I’m in my first term of Computer Engineering at the University of Waterloo, in the co&#8209;op program, and I’m looking for a co&#8209;op from May to August 2027.</p>

      <div class="body">
        <p>At Waterloo I’m on the autonomy software team at the Waterloo Aerial Robotics Group, where I built the <a href="/projects/image-stitcher/">image stitcher</a> that turns drone photos into one map. On my own I’ve been building <a href="/projects/andon/">Andon</a> since October.</p>
        <p>Before Waterloo I spent almost three years at Spirit of Math: first as an assistant teacher for classes of 16, teaching lessons and contest-style algebra, then running drop-in homework help sessions as one of two staff, for students from kindergarten to Grade 11.</p>
        <p>In my last year of high school I was school treasurer, managing a $21,000 budget across 42 clubs.</p>
        <p>I take photos on a Canon EOS 90D. In high school I was a photographer for the yearbook, the athletic council and Bayview TV, and I still shoot for fun. <a href="/photography/">See my photography</a></p>
        <p>Outside engineering, I play sports like basketball and pickleball, watch TV shows, movies and anime, read comics and manga, and play video and board games. Someday I want to travel and get to know more of the world and its cultures.</p>
      </div>

      <section aria-labelledby="edu-h">
        <h2 id="edu-h">Education</h2>
        <dl class="list">
          <div><dt>University of Waterloo</dt><dd>BASc in Computer Engineering, Co-op. September 2026 to April 2031, expected.</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Bayview Secondary School</dt><dd>2022 to 2026</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="awards-h">
        <h2 id="awards-h">Awards</h2>
        <ul class="list">
          <li>{awards.fblc2025}</li>
          <li>{awards.fbla2024}</li>
          <li>Euclid (86/100) and Hypatia (33/40) Honour Roll, and Fermat and CSMC Distinction, University of Waterloo math contests, 2025 to 2026</li>
          <li>Excellence in Mathematics, Bayview Secondary School Mathematics Department, 2025 and 2026</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="else-h">
        <h2 id="else-h">A few other things</h2>
        <ul class="list">
          <li>My best Rubik’s cube solve is <span class="num">14.21</span> seconds.</li>
          <li>I love blowing my money on collectibles, especially ones I get to build, like LEGO and Gunpla. My favourites so far are the really big LEGO Technic <i>2 Fast 2 Furious</i> Nissan Skyline and the MG 1/100 MSN-06S Sinanju.</li>
          <li>I’ve had a turtle, a cat and parakeets. I have a dog now, and I’d like guinea pigs next.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <p class="more"><a href="/resume/">Read my resume</a> <span class="dim">or email</span> <a href="mailto:aaryanpo@uwaterloo.ca">aaryanpo@uwaterloo.ca</a></p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .about { padding-block: calc(var(--s9) + 40px) var(--s10); align-items: start; }
  .side { grid-column: 1 / 6; position: sticky; top: var(--s6); }
  :global(.about-photo) { display: block; }
  :global(.about-photo img) { width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; object-fit: cover; }
  .main { grid-column: 7 / 13; display: grid; gap: var(--s6); max-width: 36em; }
  h1 { font-size: var(--t-title); line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .lead { font-size: var(--t-lead); line-height: 1.4; }
  .body { display: grid; gap: var(--s4); }
  section { margin-top: var(--s5); }
  h2 { font-size: var(--t-h3); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.25; margin-bottom: var(--s4); }
  .list { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: grid; }
  .list > div, .list > li { padding-block: var(--s3); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .list dt { font-weight: 500; }
  .list dd { margin: 0; color: var(--dim); }
  .more { margin-top: var(--s5); }
  .more .dim { margin-inline: 0.3em; }
  @media (max-width: 759px) {
    .about { padding-top: var(--s7); row-gap: var(--s7); }
    .side { grid-column: 1 / 13; position: static; }
    .main { grid-column: 1 / 13; }
  }
</style>
